    "body": "> Interesting, could Fetch have used something else?\r\n\r\nI wasn't involved in the original discussion, but if I understand it correctly it was a compromise to ensure that `response.arrayBuffer()` and friends would never return partial output. @yutakahirano probably knows the history better than me.",
