    "updated_at": "2021-02-01T08:57:34Z",
    "body": "Looks like https://github.com/yutakahirano/fetch-with-streams/issues/13 has some background and https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/issues/452#issuecomment-60711742 also goes into it. Still not sure I understand why other APIs would not want the same kind of guarantees. Seems @domenic might know as well. (I was involved, but I have forgotten most of that...)",
