    "updated_at": "2021-06-29T18:05:21Z",
    "body": "After having just gone through the implementation for Node.js core, I'd definitely be +1 on a `disturbed` property on `ReadableStream`. It wouldn't necessarily stop us from creating new Readers if the stream is not locked but it would help to inform on the current state.",
